997..1071 Comment "/// The state-passing handler: a read continues at the state it reads, and"
1072..1142 Comment "/// a store runs the rest from the state it stores. The fold reaches a"
1143..1214 Comment "/// read\'s rest by applying its continuation, one stage below the read."
